# {{.Title}}

A Bevy game starter for [Vapour](https://vapour.ink).

## Project layout

- `src/` — your game code
- `assets/` — game assets
- `build/web/` — exported web build for `vapour publish`

## Export for web

Recommended:

1. `rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown`
2. Build with Trunk using relative URLs:

```sh
trunk build --release --public-url ./ --dist build/web
```

Alternative:

```sh
cargo build --profile wasm-release --target wasm32-unknown-unknown
wasm-bindgen --target web --out-dir build/web --out-name game target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/wasm-release/{{.Slug}}.wasm
```

The template enables Bevy `webgl2`, includes wasm-js getrandom config, and a wasm-optimized release profile.

When your game exits (`AppExit`) on web, the template calls `window.vapour.quit()` (if present) so the Vapour
player can return to store/home/reload/stay according to `[runtime].on_quit`.

## Publish to Vapour

1. `vapour publish`
